## ⚠️ Error Handling

### Semantic Error Types

```zig
pub const SemanticError = union(enum) {
    undefined_variable: struct { name: []const u8 },
    duplicate_declaration: struct { name: []const u8 },
    type_mismatch: struct { expected: Type, got: Type },
    wrong_arg_count: struct { expected: usize, got: usize },
    const_reassignment: struct { name: []const u8 },
    non_bool_condition: struct { got: Type },
    non_function_call: struct { got: Type },
};
```

### Error Reporting Format

```
Error: Type mismatch
  expected: i32
  got: f64
  at line 5, column 10

  const x: i32 = 3.14;  // ← error here
                    ^^^
```

